0.  SUMMARY  (orientation only; the operative terms are Sections 1-10)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains two kinds of thing, licensed separately:

  * SOURCE CODE — the raag_fusion package and the training, prediction and
    upload scripts. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  * MODEL ARTEFACTS — the trained weights, the learned fusion parameters, the
    raag templates, the pitch-histogram model and the accompanying
    configuration. Licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: attribution required,
    non-commercial use only, derivatives under the same terms.

The Author wrote the code and trained the weights, and so has standing to
license both. The Author has chosen to license the Model Artefacts under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. This choice is consistent with the research-oriented terms
under which the Source Dataset is distributed, but does not depend on a claim
that those terms legally propagate into trained model weights. Section 4
sets out the training-data provenance in full, because You are entitled to know
it before You build on this.

