  (b)  teaching, private study and self-directed learning of raag structure;

  (c)  reproducing, verifying, benchmarking and critiquing the published
       results;

  (d)  building non-commercial tools, demonstrations and educational
       applications; and

  (e)  fine-tuning and extension for any of the above, subject to Section 3.3.


