6.  RESPONSIBLE USE RECOMMENDATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following uses are strongly discouraged and are outside the intended scope
of this research release:

  (a)  use of the Model as a component of, or a starting point for, any generative
       or voice-synthesis system intended to reproduce or imitate the voice,
       style or performance of any identifiable performer;

  (b)  present the Model's output as authoritative musicological
       identification

  (c)  use the Model to make consequential decisions about people —
       assessment, examination, grading, hiring, admission or ranking of
       musicians — or in any context where a misclassification carries material
       consequence for an individual; or

  (e)  represent that the Model was trained on licensed or cleared audio, or
       that any rightsholder, performer or platform endorsed, authorised or
       reviewed it.

These statements describe the Author's intended and responsible use of the Model
and do not modify the permissions granted by CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.


